{"ref":"BDB, הוֹר","hw":"הוֹר","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹר</span>]</big>  assumed by Thes al. as ancient form for <span dir=\"rtl\">הַר</span> <em>mountain</em>, to explain <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹרַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:26\" href=\"/Genesis.49.26\">Gn 49:26</a>, read <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹרֵי־עָד</span>; but better <span dir=\"rtl\">הַרֲרֵי־עַד</span> <em>everlasting mountains</em>, v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, הַר²\" href=\"/BDB,_הַר²\", dir=\"rtl\">הַר</a> sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, הרר\" href=\"/BDB,_הרר\", dir=\"rtl\">הרר</a>.","next":"BDB, הוֹשָׁמָע","prev":"BDB, הוֹן"}